{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_title", "source_sha256": "9f3ca62941db35515f11bcbb4ffb44954059cecb34408d1fe8c1877fea715dc1", "ja": "美也とおでかけ2", "zh": "和美也外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5503bfd1b662cecbe9018f0b083f151d82227d730d6ccc37454d8bb854ecb52", "ja": "美也とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与美也外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "56bdf3620a23ca3d58647c9c5998b9bb016c840e5d34b30387fe9895f7f6538b", "ja": "（美也が近くの商店街を見て歩きたいと\nいうので、付き合うことになった）", "zh": "（美也说想去逛逛附近的商店街，所以我就陪她一起去了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "8e6e1d38ba4e6ee0fa344377a68369b927d5e91f0193398d6bc84830718b9d37", "ja": "ふむふむ……知らない街を散歩するのは、\nいいものですね～。新鮮な気持ちになります～。", "zh": "嗯嗯……在陌生的街道上散步，感觉真不错呢～。让人有种新鲜的感觉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "a32b3edf18abe4c0b9ec73d2d2e75c21127d3546c8e28dd07c216277f99ffde8", "ja": "{$P$}さんもいっしょに\n来てくれましたし、とっても楽しいですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也一起\n过来了，真的好开心呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bf3f9b5dbd065e2659e307599548be9818d96829f8bafbe6f23ad6d47b083ba2", "ja": "ああ、頭をリフレッシュさせたかったからな。\nそれに小腹も空いてきたし……。", "zh": "啊，因为我也想让脑子放松一下。\n而且也有点饿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "50ae28b1c3cbf35b5f83bd5c60789c1a9954c5a8691c976dc08df152ee451b6c", "ja": "それは好都合というやつですな～。\nおや、あそこの店先に並んでいるのは……。", "zh": "那可真是正合适呢～  \n哎呀，排在那家店门口的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "381d36a703449f557030b453cc0439c13db464b841ac40956c11077d6c6e5a5f", "ja": "すだちと鳴門金時ですね～。早速、新鮮な\n食材を見つけることができましたよ～。", "zh": "是香橙和鸣门金时呢～。马上就找到新鲜的食材了哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9729774626a18a0adf1628ceec9ee803a44fe892795531c61c2907417e404be0", "ja": "食材？", "zh": "食材？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "a22a68881ae3127d6f0089231c607a757e099391ee7627e9ff3609ee9df41195", "ja": "はい～。実は、おいしそうなパン屋さんを見つけて、\nパンを買ってしまいまして……。", "zh": "是呀～其实我发现了一家看起来很好吃的面包店，就买了些面包……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "35d5fb7185da84995f5aed80f6b15079b4a0446eb3f987577c58729470d0a70d", "ja": "せっかくなので、徳島の名産をたくさん乗せて、\nオープンサンドを作ろうかと～。ふふふ。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我想多放些德岛特产，做个开放式三明治～嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "da79b2e0b092f2b7e70fd21ee2f8ba9714739516aea5420f7af9f2ff94f1724b", "ja": "好都合ってそういう意味か……。わかった！\n改めて新作サンドイッチ作り、最後まで付き合うよ。", "zh": "原来是这个意思啊……好吧！\n那做新三明治的事，我就重新陪你一起忙到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
